## 19. Policy Frameworks and Incentives for Renewable Energy Adoption

### Government Initiatives and Incentives
- Governments worldwide are recognizing the crucial role of policy frameworks in facilitating the transition to renewable energy sources. These initiatives can include tax credits, grants, and subsidies aimed at reducing the financial burden on consumers and businesses.
- **Investment Tax Credit (ITC)**
  - In the United States, the ITC allows homeowners and businesses to deduct a significant percentage of the cost of installing solar energy systems from their federal taxes, incentivizing solar adoption.
